sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant Edge as CDN
    participant App as Application
    participant Loc as Local cache
    participant Dist as Distributed cache
    participant DB as Database
    Cl->>Edge: request a static asset
    alt edge hit
        Edge-->>Cl: served near the user
    else
        Edge->>App: origin fetch
    end
    App->>Loc: in-process lookup
    alt local hit
        Loc-->>App: value, nanoseconds
    else
        App->>Dist: shared lookup
        alt hit
            Dist-->>App: value, a network hop
        else
            App->>DB: read
            DB-->>App: row
            App->>Dist: populate
            App->>Loc: populate with a shorter TTL
        end
    end
    Note over Loc,Dist: each layer trades freshness for latency — decide where staleness is acceptable
